  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5917.02 Chair Van Company License Application Statement of Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5917.02 Chair Van Company License Application Statement of Certification. By signing the chair van company license application, the owner or his or her designee, shall certify that:\n\n(a) The chair van company shall operate in accordance with all applicable federal, state, and local laws or ordinances;\n\n(b) He or she is authorized to sign the application; and\n\n(c) He or she understands any material falsification of information shall result in license denial, suspension, or revocation, in accordance with Saf-C 5922.06 through Saf-C 5922.08.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
